// Development signing for `./build.sh device` — profiles minted through the
// App Store Connect API (../cadence/Tools/mint-profile.py), since this Mac has
// no Xcode account and automatic signing can't create the watch app's or the
// widget's. A command-line xcconfig applies to every target alike, so each
// target (ThrumFlow, ThrumWatch, ThrumWorkoutWidget) names its own profile in DEVICE_PROFILE (project.yml) and this just
// points at it.
CODE_SIGN_STYLE = Manual
PROVISIONING_PROFILE_SPECIFIER = $(DEVICE_PROFILE)
